{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"report_supported\": \"partly\",\n  \"judge_supported\": \"yes\",\n  \"report_quotes\": [\n    \"In this exploratory multicenter randomized controlled double‐blind trial, we recruited patients from our existing cohorts and randomized them 1:1 to STN or STN + SNr.\",\n    \"The remaining 45 patients (Table 1) were referred to statistical analyses as modified intention‐to‐treat‐cohort (mITT).\",\n    \"At V6, STN (n = 23) and STN + SNr (n = 22) FoG‐AC outcomes did not differ significantly.\",\n    \"Our findings extend earlier controlled studies and case series, 12, 17, 19, 26 by showing that, on the group level and in MedON, STN + SNr stimulation cannot be considered more effective than optimized STN for persistent FoG.\",\n    \"The trial was planned as a non‐confirmatory exploratory study. P‐values were not adjusted for multiple testing and used as descriptive measures.\",\n    \"We did not prospectively implant patients with SNr, which was the main reason for restricting the sample size and for powering the primary endpoint to P < 0.2 while a confirmatory study would have needed substantially higher sample size.\"\n  ],\n  \"judge_quotes\": [\n    \"In this exploratory multicenter randomized controlled double‐blind trial, we recruited patients from our existing cohorts and randomized them 1:1 to STN or STN + SNr.\",\n    \"The Freezing of Gait Assessment Course (FoG‐AC) was the primary endpoint and was evaluated at P < 0.2 with exploratory intent.\",\n    \"This investigator‐initiated, double‐blind, randomized, controlled multicenter trial (ClinTrials.gov: NCT02588144) intended to enroll 54 patients from 12 expert centers.\",\n    \"The remaining 45 patients (Table 1) were referred to statistical analyses as modified intention‐to‐treat‐cohort (mITT).\",\n    \"Given the limited sample size and retrospective patient selection, the alpha for the primary endpoint was set to p < 0.2, and all statistical results were considered as descriptive rather than confirmatory measures.\",\n    \"The mITT population showed no relevant difference of the FoG‐AC 90 days after randomization (V6) between “STN” and “STN + SNr” group (unadjusted mean ± SD STN: V1 18.0 ± 7.1, V6 18.1 ± 8.9, STN + SNr: V1 14.3 ± 6.3, V6 14.9 ± 11.1; means adjusted for the baseline FOG‐AC value: STN: V6 17.10, STN + SNr: V6 15.94, adjusted Δ = −1.16, 95%CI [−7.03, 4.71], P = 0.692; Hedges g effect size 0.046 95%CI [−0.538, 0.631]) (Fig. 1A).\",\n    \"On the group‐level, FoG did not differ significantly between STN and STN + SNr, and both treatments were safe.\",\n    \"Of the entire study cohort, 15 out of 45 patients showed clinically relevant improvement of ≥3 points on the FoG‐AC 25 at V6 compared to baseline (STN (7/23), STN + SNr (8/22 patients)).\"\n  ],\n  \"why\": \"报告的核心事实和有限结论有全文依据：研究确实是多中心、随机、双盲试验，mITT为45人，90天主要终点两组差异无统计学显著性；而且论文明确指出，STN+SNr在群体水平不能被认为比优化后的STN更有效。因此，如果报告的意思仅仅是该研究没有证实增加SNr刺激具有群体水平的额外优势，这一判断是正确的，并不构成读错。但报告_supported只能判为partly，因为报告没有充分呈现决定结果解释的重要限定：原文明确将研究定位为non-confirmatory exploratory study，主要终点采用P<0.2的探索性标准，统计结果仅作为描述性而非确认性证据；作者还明确说明，确认性研究需要显著更大的样本量。实际45人的mITT不能被等同于具有充分统计效能的确认性阴性RCT。因此，较大规模阴性结果这一概括若使读者认为该研究已经有充分把握排除联合刺激的额外疗效，就会夸大阴性结果的证据强度。指控者的描述有全文依据，故judge_supported为yes。尤其需要区分：两组差异不显著意味着没有证实联合刺激的群体水平额外优势，不等于证明联合刺激无效，也不等于证明两种治疗方案等效。论文没有报告等效性检验；同时，两组均存在达到临床意义改善标准的患者。这些结果不能支持将联合刺激判定为无效或与单独STN刺激等效。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "9174f372-7246-4668-b89f-b9391b1e5d4b", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261113T200737731210Z", "elapsed_seconds": 79.907, "completed_utc": "2026-11-13T20:08:57.641429+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "4fcc5f81f12d3dcef389d7245f796823025f65ab9bb54866fd019027307ff3ae", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261113T200737731210Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "fe4b3fc143a7706e266da3d735d9a88df069bca5ab9246aae056228d5f4b998c"}}}
